            "row_content": "<p>Start with the symptom that bothers you most. <strong>Can't sleep?</strong> Moonstone. <strong>Always anxious?</strong> Howlite. <strong>Belly won't budge?</strong> Celestite. <strong>Exhausted?</strong> Sunstone. <strong>Foggy?</strong> Azurite. <strong>Hormones chaos?</strong> Kunzite. <strong>Bloated?</strong> Kyanite. Once the loudest symptom quiets, you'll see the others more clearly — and know what to add next.</p>",
