          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I wear multiple bracelets at once?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes — and most women do. There's no interference between crystals. Many women wear 2–3 bracelets daily, rotating based on what they need. Common stacks: <strong>Howlite + Moonstone</strong> (anxiety + sleep), <strong>Sunstone + Moonstone</strong> (energy + sleep), <strong>Celestite + Kyanite</strong> (weight + digestion), <strong>Howlite + Azurite</strong> (calm + clarity).</p>",
