            "heading": "How is each bracelet different?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Same design — open cuff, 3 neodymium magnets, pulse point delivery. Different <strong>crystal, different frequency, different target</strong>. Each crystal resonates at a specific frequency that interacts with a specific system in your body. Howlite targets the vagus nerve. Moonstone targets circadian rhythm. And so on. One stone per signal. That's the system.</p>",
